{"id": "line_2328", "source_line": 2328, "timestamp_utc": "2026-09-25T06:44:59.697Z", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_line_sha256": "ce54e9e9851c4e01e5d596d89b4dda08fe62d64bdb98465e8cfa0320f7e52ea9", "original_visible_text_sha256": "e6ca14f536fb6cb1ecba96e7443239bf18c71eceb6fbddb68bee81513a0151fd", "excerpt_span": [0, 101], "excerpt_sha256": "e6ca14f536fb6cb1ecba96e7443239bf18c71eceb6fbddb68bee81513a0151fd", "text": "目前已通过的逐窗口比较没有发现算术差异。批量仿真碰到一个测试脚本问题：超时常量位宽不足，导致提前结束；我已修正并重跑，失败日志也会保留。集成仿真已经完成首次检测和结果读回，正在继续检查长帧与模板复用。\n", "selection_note": "Exact visible message excerpt"}
{"id": "line_2428", "source_line": 2428, "timestamp_utc": "2026-09-25T06:51:56.105Z", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_line_sha256": "29d3bc0de1660581faa717376bc98294b837d52105a765009214695cae0a0b7d", "original_visible_text_sha256": "660fe121f416ea8eda3e18b719f14fe12fcf39674e9a6f6b7a053b22b6c89902", "excerpt_span": [0, 141], "excerpt_sha256": "660fe121f416ea8eda3e18b719f14fe12fcf39674e9a6f6b7a053b22b6c89902", "text": "新版本已生成 bitstream，50 MHz 时序检查通过，JTAG 也确认连到正确的 XC7Z100。我正在下载并做实板核对；这一步会验证长帧检测、逐窗口读回、非法输入恢复和旧点积功能。当前资源占用约为 3024 个 LUT、19.5 个 BRAM 等效块和 4 个 DSP。\n", "selection_note": "Exact visible message excerpt"}
{"id": "line_3172", "source_line": 3172, "timestamp_utc": "2026-09-25T08:11:40.784Z", "role": "assistant", "phase": "final_answer", "original_line_sha256": "e610c1fd660fbcc6c78cfa63d6e1125a0e8fd2bdec9812dd9c14728bbb88214a", "original_visible_text_sha256": "016c14b4a847f16a0a2c4a37896026cdc6c8da228abec52f4673d08a3fb1280b", "excerpt_span": [495, 704], "excerpt_sha256": "dd56e412dea72d904ec0b60c2f49601d4f737bd7e07c336bd35a0b4bcce78d54", "text": "**A 的依据最充分。** 当前一次 1024 点完整调用约 13.96 ms，其中约 **12.09 ms、也就是 86.6%**，用在 CPU 读取窗口结果和挑选最佳位置。把这部分放进 FPGA，优化空间明确；具体提升仍以上板实测为准。串口传输时间需要另算。\n\n**B 的演示变化最明显。** 例如一帧中放三个目标，网页就标出三个位置。需要同时解决“同一个目标附近出现多个峰、被重复计数”的问题，并测试漏检和误报。", "selection_note": "Exact contiguous technical excerpt"}
