{"id": "line_3256", "source_line": 3256, "timestamp_utc": "2026-09-25T08:19:12.253Z", "role": "assistant", "phase": "commentary", "original_line_sha256": "adcd003b4fcc937568c8986fb84f4ceaf4160f579d646922170af636250201d3", "original_visible_text_sha256": "ff91d16e4d9e29dce2ffcaf34bf68245d6a64642226f2aa05394fe52a8047102", "excerpt_span": [0, 80], "excerpt_sha256": "ff91d16e4d9e29dce2ffcaf34bf68245d6a64642226f2aa05394fe52a8047102", "text": "新版本固件已编译通过，旧版 A3 的归档复核也仍然通过。接下来做仿真，重点检查阈值等号、并列峰、全零输入和最大数值，确保硬件选峰不会因位宽或时序问题改变答案。\n", "selection_note": "Exact visible message excerpt"}
